[{"client_msg_id":"298fcc3a-413e-4f69-ab05-9b642f35b56e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Slack API 何も信用できない","ts":"1625390858.236400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"gunnyari","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U06ECBRTJ","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gw6M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"353af7d3-b587-4caf-8773-abdee972b90f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"たぶんそう \u0026gt;不安定なの知らなかった","ts":"1625390852.236200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JUp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"522bb457-a092-4c38-9187-c55669eb6553","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"とりあえずなんもわからん状態になっているのでコードをぼちぼち読んでいこう","ts":"1625390597.235900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OmT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b399b2aa-96ed-4c7a-a69a-71ec6ec6059b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"構造体が読めないデータは保存しなくてもいいよね、というのはレスポンスが安定してる場合の話だよなって思う(当時そこまで不安定なの知られていなかった気がする、もう覚えてないけど)","ts":"1625390449.235500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V3X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf5b1645-4ec7-49ee-b89a-67f941c49a55","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちなみに生と言っても pagination されているレスポンスを結合するくらいは必要","ts":"1625390363.234700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UYcI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b21a0e04-6706-4bc4-b622-dccc9fe2a1cd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"構造体がないと変換時にデータを扱えないから、構造体が読めないデータは保存しなくてもいいよね、みたいな話だったと思うのだけど、実際は後で必要になってからログを取り直すのは難しすぎるのでひとまず生で保存しちゃって使うときは後から考えた方がよさそう","ts":"1625390348.234300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nd="}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f1e5b20-dee0-4beb-851c-7d67b906e6ac","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"できるならそうした方がいいと個人的には思ってます。しかし Revert で戻すとかではもう不可能なくらい古いので書き直さないと行けない気がする。たぶん","ts":"1625390248.232700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1wy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c38dfe6a-d701-41ad-9901-946fa0dc1680","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"保存時にvalidateする必要はないと思う","ts":"1625390217.232000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kMK7q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28e34a59-3963-4d23-8102-db437928dd28","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"一旦戻します？","ts":"1625390198.231200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1OE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4af82f5-7e2f-407c-b009-0530e5bc5cd8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Slack の API は不安定すぎるので、ぶっちゃけ保存時は 構造体に落とさないで interface{} のまま取得してそのまま JSON にした方がいい気がしている。最初はそうしていたのだけどなんかリファクタが入って今の形になってしまった","ts":"1625390176.230600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J+K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d61ba5fa-eb0a-4ecb-a1a0-eed4656362a7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"今はマークアップ形式のテキストデータをパースしているのだけど、そもそもマークアップでは表現不能な発言も作れるのはご存知の通り。blocks のデータがないと正確な描画はできません (最終的にやるかは置いとくにしても今はやりたくてもできない)","ts":"1625390125.230100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QOagH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45ee6b2d-c559-4de8-bc0e-0fbecf840871","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"色々調べるとなると個人ワークスペースで動かしてみるべきか","ts":"1625390045.228500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oTk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16389a48-186b-4690-8855-a93b7e02abff","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"polly だけじゃなくて全発言に入ってます。WYSIWYG がデフォルトで入ったじゃないですか。これを正確に表現するためには blocks のデータが必要になる","ts":"1625390041.228300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WyvFC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9f98b32-17dd-4aab-ba42-2562cf61bdb2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"blocksってpollyとかが使ってるやつですよね","ts":"1625390001.227200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"90fx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56b250d3-b103-4150-9458-65b43ed349fe","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ログを取得するのに一回 Go の構造体に落としてから JSON に保存しているのだけど、Go の構造体が Slack の返す JSON 構造に対応していなくて割と重要なデータが欠落している","ts":"1625389957.226100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rOTm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"156c90da-6adc-4d6f-8ef4-8d69cff10806","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちなみに個人的に今一番やりたいのはログ取得時に各発言の blocks を正しく保存する対応","ts":"1625389839.224900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PNy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f6127d6-2685-429a-b0ae-8ca85741344e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ログに貼り付いているデータは使えないのかな","ts":"1625389714.224200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7UBG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cec56f7e-e488-4158-a5fa-c2595a99c3af","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なお、ユーザー一覧の取得は毎回やる必要がある","ts":"1625389693.223900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q/cNg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"066c4743-795c-4c0b-9600-ccaa2e970ef7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`\"avatar_hash\"` というのがある。もしかしたらこれが更新されるかも? そうであればこの値を保存しておけば更新されたかのチェックはできそう","ts":"1625389679.223500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XhG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be974247-80ef-43e9-9d4f-b0b8f1a29e6e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u