04e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"やってくれていいですよ！","ts":"1625389506.220800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uFdc0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de55af5c-3f69-457c-9ea7-acd537da99e0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":rikai:","ts":"1625389495.220500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CAdq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1539dd5-52d7-405b-a445-2fb950655ccf","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/slacklog-generator/issues/147\u003e","ts":"1625389489.220300","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/slacklog-generator/issues/147|#147 ユーザーのアイコンも自前ホストする?\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/slacklog-generator/issues/147|#147 ユーザーのアイコンも自前ホストする?\u003e","text":"現状、ユーザーのアイコンは Slack の資源への直リンクになっている。  \n添付ファイルや絵文字はダウンロードしているので、ユーザーのアイコンも取得してホストした方がよいかもしれない。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/slacklog-generator|vim-jp/slacklog-generator\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1597422090}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7EC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef41b931-cb42-4ad4-b211-d0da336332eb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"対応漏れ","ts":"1625389475.220000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JefJY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"901f1d9d-0943-4262-9583-79494a2c18b5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"意図的ではない","ts":"1625389466.219800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k6r=f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a00cabd-8fb3-4e94-87e6-8ec1fc99fa30","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そういえば前から気になっていたんですが、みなさんのアイコンがダウンロード対象じゃないのは意図的な物なんでしたっけ","ts":"1625389398.219600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Sl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afe1e396-0413-490d-ad47-f1d7f864f878","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"将来リファクタリングするって書かれたまま放置されているコードが結構あるけど私にはどうすればいいのかわからない","ts":"1625388536.218500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R++"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e642af95-8ce3-4cad-b8c6-f765e05c08d3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Go スラスラ書ける人、slacklog 手伝ってくれると嬉しいなあ","ts":"1625388470.218100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6=/KQ"}]}]
